    {
      "uid": "zhcn:935b4ccc4526a12ad5eede55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢大家帮我加油──！如果有人稍微对风水\\n开始感兴趣，请一定要告诉我喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9287fbd14f643dedb3c21d3f3ee3dfdfeb415ac95136d208f332b73dfd9e4b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "919"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d24821c9768d6d86a9545363",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "果然还是一路领先到底……吧？总之！\\n我会朝着胜者舞台的C位醒目地冲刺☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c85a35327dea785cd06ced2e2f7a0f779afe9b440d29f5faf9b789d7278e10fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "92"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ed016ac16b8361f6ea3ef0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的吗！？我好开心喔！你也利用风水\\n变幸福吧，我会仔细教你的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ac91ecd95853ca0d8f4577b4d6a59af32ff6be0110415fbaba6eb57ffacdd3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "920"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7c74d5c803ca17d85a85b44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "工作运势一定会变好！公事包、笔、名片夹，\\n这些我也建议换成新的喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e925061783ef1c134a26d8d638f9fb722d56edfe38b8f400d32deba5e30132f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "921"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22b79afaa3e551d08fb39547",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我弟弟妹妹好像都来到现场了♪\\n姐姐很努力喔──！谢谢你们──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f778a61a7e8f54502f132cc76e147999db83a16e669011dc9398d0c5472ef698",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "922"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4006bb2c5abe24794055df39",
